#. +> trunk5
#: ../../user_manual/viewops.rst:12
#, fuzzy
msgid "The ``Configure - KStars`` window is divided into fourteen pages: ``Catalogs``, ``Solar System``, ``Satellites``, ``Supernovae``, ``Guides``, ``Terrain``, ``Image Overlays``, ``Colors``, ``FITS``, ``INDI``, ``Ekos``, ``Xplanet``, ``Advanced`` and ``Developer``."
msgstr "La fenêtre ``Configurer - KStars `` est divisée en quatorze pages : `` Catalogues ``, `` Système solaire ``, `` Satellites ``, `` Supernovae ``, `` Guides ``, `` Terrain ``, `` Superpositions d'images ``, `` Couleurs ``, `` AJUSTEMENTS ``, `` INDI ``, `` Ekos ``, `` Xplanet ``, `` Avancé `` et `` Développeur ``."

#. +> trunk5
#: ../../user_manual/viewops.rst:17
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "In the <guilabel>Catalogs</guilabel> page, you determine several properties concerning the display of the star and deep sky object catalogs."
msgid "In the ``Catalogs`` page, you determine several properties concerning the display of the star and deep sky object catalogs."
msgstr "Sur la page des <guilabel>Catalogues</guilabel>, Vous pouvez choisir plusieurs configurations concernant l'affichage des catalogues des étoiles et des objets du ciel profond."

#. +> trunk5
#: ../../user_manual/viewops.rst:21
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "In the <guilabel>Solar System</guilabel> page, you can specify whether the Sun, Moon, planets, comets and asteroids are displayed."
msgid "In the ``Solar System`` page, you can specify whether the Sun, Moon, planets, comets and asteroids are displayed."
msgstr "Sur la page du <guilabel>Système solaire</guilabel>, vous pouvez spécifier si le Soleil, la Lune, les planètes, les comètes et les astéroïdes sont affichés."

#. +> trunk5
#: ../../user_manual/viewops.rst:24
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "The <guilabel>Satellites</guilabel> page allows you to set the satellites view options."
msgid "The ``Satellites`` page allows you to set the satellites view options."
msgstr "L'onglet des <guilabel>satellites</guilabel> vous permet de définir les options d'affichage des satellites."

#. +> trunk5
#: ../../user_manual/viewops.rst:27
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "The <guilabel>Supernovae</guilabel> page allows you to manage how supernovae are displayed by &kstars;."
msgid "The ``Supernovae`` page allows you to manage how supernovae are displayed by KStars."
msgstr "L'onglet <guilabel>Supernova</guilabel> permet de gérer la manière dont les supernova sont affichées dans &kstars;."

#. +> trunk5
#: ../../user_manual/viewops.rst:30
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "The <guilabel>Guides</guilabel> page lets you toggle whether non-objects are displayed (&ie;, constellation lines, constellation names, the Milky Way contour)."
msgid "The ``Guides`` page lets you toggle whether non-objects are displayed (i.e., constellation lines, constellation names, the Milky Way contour)."
msgstr "La page des <guilabel>Guides</guilabel> vous permet d'afficher ou non les non-objets (c'est-à-dire les lignes de constellations, leurs noms ou encore le contour de la Voie Lactée)."

#. +> trunk5
#: ../../user_manual/viewops.rst:34
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "It is possible to choose a <guilabel>Sky culture:</guilabel> for the constellation lines and names on this page. The current version of &kstars; includes data for more than a dozen sky cultures."
